// Sofinco OAuth login button (React Island).
// Fires the jahia-oauth flow: popup -> .connectToSofincoAction.do -> postMessage -> reload with ?site=.
// The OAuth connector backend (SofincoApi + the actions-sofinco.cfg) lives in packages/sofinco-core.
// Namespaces (sofnt:, sofmix:) are declared in settings/definitions.cnd — do not re-declare here.
[sofnt:loginButton] > jnt:content, mix:title, sofmix:component
 - buttonLabel (string) i18n
 - redirectUrl (string)
 - variant (string, choicelist[resourceBundle]) = 'primary' autocreated < 'primary', 'secondary', 'accent'
